<title>SINGAPORE: Lucent wins $48 million Malaysia contract.</title>
<headline>Lucent wins $48 million Malaysia contract.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lucent Technologies said on Friday it had been awarded a US$48 million contract by Malaysia's largest mobile service operator Celcom to enhance Malaysia's Global System for Mobile Communications (GSM) network.</p>
<p>Lucent would help improve and enhance the current GSM network coverage in northern and eastern Peninsular Malaysia and East Malaysia states of Sabah and Sarawak under Celcom's phase four telecommunications plan, said a company statement.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
